# Senior CI/CD

- QA (lint/validate/test/security) sempre; `[skip-cd]` so pula deploy/infra
- OIDC `id-token: write`; sem client secret de longa duracao
- Cache por hash de lock/requirements; matriz paralela quando fizer sentido
- Imagens por SHA curto; nao promover `latest` a prod
- Gates: Ruff → mypy → pytest cov-branch 100% → Bandit → pip-audit → Hadolint → tflint/tfsec → kubeconform → Trivy
- Doc: `docs/engineering-senior-bar.md`; skill: `mcs-senior-cloud-ops` + `mcs-precommit`
